+Figures~\ref{fig:form1} to~\ref{fig:form3} show its five pages as participants saw them, signed out, with no
+answers entered. Part~A is the System Usability Scale, Part~B six items about ChronoMap, Part~C two open
+questions, and Part~D questions about the participant and the session.
